        "lines and fills a composite or profile uses are matched by name; its building materials and surfaces, and the "
        "layers of a layer combination, keep their index only with referencesByIndex, since Archicad does not read "
        "these types from a closed file. An attribute with a reference that cannot be mapped is not imported. A new "
        "attribute gets a new guid: Archicad does not hand out the guids stored in the source file. An attribute whose "
